    "Scholar quote 'The natural heat and moisture of the earth produce this inflammable air, which collects in the mine until a lighted candle causes an explosion equal to gunpowder' is not verbatim in the evidence; it composites separate OCR passages. [B:1214:0]",
    "Wikipedian quote 'It comes from coalbed methane, generated with coal and trapped in the seam and surrounding rock' [W:505455:1345728236] is not found in the provided evidence (no new search run).",
